:''Not to be confused with [[Farmer Cat (Special Cat)|Farmer Cat]].''
'''Ancient Egg: N110''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked from the [[Catnip Challenges]] after completing 50 [[Behemoth Culling]] stages for the first time. It was added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]]. [[True Form]] increases cost and recharge time, but improves almost all other attributes, is immune to [[Wave Attack]]s and has Behemoth Slayer.

