==Trivia==
*While the Japanese names of Farmboy Cat and [[Farmer Cat (Special Cat)|Farmer Cat]] can both be translated as "Cat Farmer", they aren't exactly the same, as they use different words to say "Farmer". Farmboy Cat uses ファーマー ''fāmā'' (a transliteration of the English word ''farmer''), while Farmer Cat uses 農家 ''nōka'' (the Japanese word for farmer).
*In the French translation of [[The Battle Cats]], Farmboy Cat and Farmer Cat are both named "Chagriculteur", a portmanteau of ''chat'' (cat) and ''agriculteur'' (farmer).

